1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,333
4:44. The phone rings.

2
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:08,667
Not a bell. A bell would be normal. It
sounds like someone dialing from very
far away.

3
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:13,567
That's our old kitchen phone. From the
apartment. That is exactly the sound.

4
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:18,200
Her hand is already moving. She lifts
the receiver before I can say a word.

5
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,600
Don't speak! Not a word!
